Package: annotateTLS
Type: Package
Title: Detection and Annotation of Tertiary Lymphoid Structures in Spatial Transcriptomics Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jane", "Doe",
      email = "jane@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides comprehensive tools for detecting and annotating tertiary lymphoid structures (TLS)
    in spatial transcriptomics data. Includes statistical thresholding methods, confidence scoring,
    parameter optimization, and validation frameworks for robust TLS identification.
